        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Discover the ease and convenience of traveling to Safaga, a therapeutic haven on Egypt’s Red Sea coast. This guide will walk you through the various travel options available for both local and international visitors, ensuring a smooth journey to this serene destination."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "o1h2y0595ntw",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "From "
            },
            {
              "_key": "pcs1gw69jzp5",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong",
                "2jtu4gz5j5pn"
              ],
              "text": "Cairo"
            },
            {
              "_key": "4vsyg2unok1m",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": " to Safaga: The SuperJet Bus Experience"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "2jtu4gz5j5pn",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-83284",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "For travelers embarking from Cairo, reaching Safaga is a breeze with the SuperJet bus service. Conveniently located at Tahrir, Torgoman, and Almaza stops, these buses offer a comfortable and efficient way to travel. While advance booking isn’t necessary, it’s advisable to arrive at the terminals 30 minutes early to secure a seat. Enjoy the journey in air-conditioned comfort, and check the schedule and prices online for your planning convenience."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "t5jysvjx7vcr",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "International Connections via "
            },
            {
              "_key": "9g4l0shp9zyy",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong",
                "qfznszr07hlp"
              ],
              "text": "Hurghada"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "qfznszr07hlp",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58859",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "International visitors have the option to connect to Safaga through Hurghada International Airport. Upon landing, a short 40-minute journey by bus or taxi will whisk you away to the enchanting town of Safaga. This easy connection makes Safaga an accessible destination for travelers from around the globe."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Flying Directly to Hurghada with Egypt Air"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000f",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Egypt Air, the national airline, operates daily direct flights to Hurghada. This convenient option brings you closer to Safaga, with only a short connecting ride remaining. Upon arrival in Hurghada, travelers are greeted with a plethora of well-equipped lodging facilities, complete with restaurants, discos, supermarkets, and more, tempting you to extend your stay."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
