          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000015",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Exploring Safaga is hassle-free, thanks to the readily available taxis and mini-buses offering reasonable fares. Whether you’re heading to a specific destination or just exploring the town, these transport options are always at your service. Additionally, hotels in Safaga are well-prepared to enhance your experience, organizing desert excursions, boat trips, and guided tours in various languages. Simply inquire at the hotel reception, and sign up for an adventure that appeals to you."
            }
          ],
          "level": 1,
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000017",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In this guide, the journey to and around Safaga is demystified, showcasing the town’s accessibility and the ease with which visitors can explore its wonders. Whether you’re traveling from within Egypt or from afar, Safaga’s therapeutic charm is just a journey away."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
